# Test and build after code changes

When you change code (including tests), do not treat the task as done until both of these succeed:

1. `go test ./...`
2. `go build ./...`

Run the packages you touched first if that helps, then still run the full test and build before finishing. If either fails, fix it and re-run. If you cannot run them, say so explicitly instead of implying they passed.
